        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Recent systemic symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient reports feeling hot and shivery a few days ago and feeling tired and flat; no temperature was documented for that episode."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "General appearance and mental status"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Looks tired and mildly unwell, not toxic; alert and orientated, answers questions, but details are variable."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Skin examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Dry eczematous skin, especially on the neck, antecubital fossae, and hands. Superimposed widespread monomorphic vesicles, punched-out erosions, and crusting on an erythematous base over the face, neck, upper chest, upper back, and proximal arms; some lesions coalesce."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Skin tenderness"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Very tender to light touch; patient winces."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Perioral skin and oral lesions"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "A few small perioral erosions; no obvious large intraoral ulcers. Patient was reluctant to open the mouth wide."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-13",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Possible secondary skin infection findings"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No classic honey-coloured crust and no frank pus; some lesions have mild surrounding erythema, with possible bacterial superinfection."
      }
    },
    {
